			"styles": "\n\t/* a ratio's whitespace normalizes in a declaration value and is preserved in a\n\tmedia query: the media reader emits its `media-value` node verbatim */\n\tdiv {\n\t\taspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\n\t\taspect-ratio: 1.777;\n\t\taspect-ratio: auto 16 / 9;\n\t}\n\n\t@media (aspect-ratio: 16 / 9) {\n\t\tbody {\n\t\t\tbackground: red;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\n\t@media (aspect-ratio: 16  /  9) {\n\t\tbody {\n\t\t\tbackground: red;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n",
